{13}{[He seems surprised.]  So the dog had a few paltry coin upon him.  It seems will not need to repeat the lesson taught to the citizens of Redord.  Very well... be on your way and do not let me see you again!}{[He seems surprised.]  So the wench had a few paltry coin upon her.  It seems will not need to repeat the lesson taught to the citizens of Redord.  Very well... be on your way and do not let me see you again!}{}{}{}{}
{14}{How dare you speak that way of our sovereign!  We shall teach you the lesson we taught Redford!  Attack in the name of Minra!}{How dare you speak that way of our sovereign!  We shall teach you the lesson we taught Redford!  Attack in the name of Minra!}{}{}{}{}
{15}{Ah... [He looks down upon you with a haughty stare]  A traveler.  I have heard it is not "safe" for travelers in these parts.  [His men snicker behind him.]  Perhaps we should see that you are taken care of?  [His hand rests upon his weapon.]  Tell me, fool...  do you know who rules the magnificent kingdom you pass through?}{Ah... [He looks down upon you with a haughty stare]  A traveler.  I have heard it is not "safe" for travelers in these parts.  [His men snicker behind him.]  Perhaps we should see that you are taken care of?  [His hand rests upon his weapon.]  Tell me, wench...  do you know who rules the magnificent kingdom you pass through?}{}{}{}{}
